# Python PEP 8 (Strict)

- Apply PEP 8 formatting and style to all Python files.
- Keep each line at 79 characters or fewer.
- Keep imports at the top of the module, grouped and ordered per PEP 8.
- Use 4 spaces for indentation, never tabs.
- Preserve exactly one newline at end of file.
- Remove trailing whitespace and whitespace-only blank lines.

Before finalizing Python edits, ensure `pycodestyle` passes for changed files.
